/ActualText (Next.js | FastAPI | Python | Hugging Face | Docker\nDeveloped an AI-powered application to generate structured Minutes of Meeting \(MoM\) from audio, video, and text.\nIntegrated AI-based transcription and summarization through a FastAPI backend.\nBuilt a responsive Next.js frontend with file upload and meeting processing workflows.\nContainerized the application using Docker with separate frontend and backend services.)
